Now update the draw method to use the plant layer and remove the old sprig/stipple block. Let me replace the section from `this.paintPlants(sim);` through the sprig stroke with the layer draw.

Current:
```
this.paintPlants(sim);
ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = true;
... drawImage plantCanvas ...
// fine spore stipple...
